@baseUrl = https://admin.finconfig.local/api/v1
@csrfToken = replace-with-finconfig-csrf-cookie-value
@requestId = 0198c2bb-56f7-7e86-b911-6c5658b429c8
@releaseId = replace-after-create
@orderRevision = 1
@currentStep = review

### Begin browser OIDC login (follow redirect in a browser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/login

### Current session (session cookie is HttpOnly)
GET {{baseUrl}}/session

### QueryPage ALL: first load includes dynamic interaction metadata
POST {{baseUrl}}/query-page
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: https://admin.finconfig.local
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}

{
  "modelCode": "payment_routes_admin",
  "scope": {"region": "cn", "environment": "production", "stage": "blue"},
  "queryType": "ALL",
  "pageNumber": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "conditions": [{"field": "enabled", "operator": "EXACT", "value": "true"}]
}

### QueryPage ONLY_DATA: pagination/filter changes reuse cached metadata
POST {{baseUrl}}/query-page
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: https://admin.finconfig.local
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}

{
  "modelCode": "payment_routes_admin",
  "scope": {"region": "cn", "environment": "production", "stage": "blue"},
  "queryType": "ONLY_DATA",
  "pageNumber": 2,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "conditions": [{"field": "channel", "operator": "IN", "set": ["VISA", "MASTERCARD"]}]
}

### Dynamic SELECT options are returned by ALL for the seeded static source
### A collection-backed option source uses the same query-page request and is
### evaluated server-side; clients never provide table names or SQL.

### Intentional validation error: priority is INT64, not free text
POST {{baseUrl}}/query-page
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: https://admin.finconfig.local
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}

{
  "modelCode": "payment_routes_admin",
  "scope": {"region": "cn", "environment": "production"},
  "queryType": "ONLY_DATA",
  "conditions": [{"field": "priority", "operator": "EXACT", "value": "not-an-integer"}]
}

### Create a release; copy revisions and before/effectiveBefore from fresh ALL data
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: https://admin.finconfig.local
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}
Idempotency-Key: 0198c2bb-56f7-7e86-b911-6c5658b429c9

{
  "modelCode": "payment_routes_admin",
  "releaseTypeCode": "direct",
  "description": "Enable VISA route",
  "scope": {"region": "cn", "environment": "production", "stage": "blue"},
  "items": [{
    "action": "ADD",
    "baseBefore": null,
    "effectiveBefore": null,
    "after": {"code": "route-a", "channel": "VISA", "priority": "1", "enabled": "true"},
    "expectedRecordRevision": 0,
    "expectedCollectionRevision": 1
  }]
}

### Execute an allowed action using the detail response's current authority
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/{{releaseId}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: https://admin.finconfig.local
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
X-Request-ID: {{requestId}}
Idempotency-Key: 0198c2bb-56f7-7e86-b911-6c5658b429ca

{
  "action": "APPROVE",
  "expectedOrderRevision": {{orderRevision}},
  "expectedCurrentStep": "{{currentStep}}",
  "comment": "Reviewed against change ticket FIN-1234"
}

### Logout requires the session-bound double-submit CSRF token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Origin: https://admin.finconfig.local
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
